{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will have to take on the roles of medieval heroes and live their stories. Betrayals, intrigues, love, brotherhood and loyalty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the secrets of an unusual universe on behalf of different characters. Each Story will unite heroes in the fight against cruel enemies and shed light on world events.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543340/extras/8957af3daf55d79cd2509f40be67e09b.poster.avif?t=1774083103\" width=780 height=236 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543340/extras/8957af3daf55d79cd2509f40be67e09b.webm?t=1774083103\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543340/extras/8957af3daf55d79cd2509f40be67e09b.mp4?t=1774083103\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Control the characters:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >warriors - from classic guards to engineers, who are at \u2018you\u2019 with siege tools and mechanisms;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >mages with all the inherent madness;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >weasels-likely to go into the shadows and affect the morale of fellow soldiers and enemies;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >druids who live in the woods and can talk to animals and spirits of the elements.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543340/extras/bae36b470bda42d94fff18de0ab721dd.poster.avif?t=1774083103\" width=780 height=236 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_ite